text.paragraph:
Apply a thin film of mometasone furoate ointment to the affected skin areas once daily. Therapy should be discontinued when control is achieved. If no improvement is seen within 2 weeks, reassessment of diagnosis may be necessary [see Warnings and Precautions (

                        5.1

                     )].

